+# Dual review: log.event echo-loop **implementation** (post-code)
+
+**Batch ID:** `log-event-echo-loop-impl`  
+**Stage:** Implementation review (code is staged / in working tree)  
+**Date:** 2026-07-31  
+**Prior gate:** RCA dual-review both `APPROVE_WITH_NITS`  
